<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Certification readiness', user, ws, active: 'readiness' }) %>

<style>

  .pack { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text); }

  .pack-title { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .pack-title-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .pack-title h1 { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.4px; margin: 0; color: var(--text); }
  .pack-title h1 .sub { display: block; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .pack-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; align-items: stretch; min-width: 170px; }
  .pack-actions .btn { justify-content: center; white-space: nowrap; }

  .pack-body { padding: 0; }

  .pack-section { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  details.pack-section > summary { margin: -18px -20px 0; padding: 16px 20px; }
  details.pack-section[open] > summary { margin-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .pack-section-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  details.pack-section > summary.pack-section-head { padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 0; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .pack-section-num { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--bg-muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-secondary); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .pack-section-title { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.2px; color: var(--text); margin: 0; flex: 1; }
  .pack-section-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-tertiary); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }

  .pack-caption { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .pack-caption .label { color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }
  .pack-source { padding: 8px 0 0; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-tertiary); line-height: 1.55; font-style: normal; }
  .pack-source strong { font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-right: 4px; }

  .wp { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12.5px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; }
  .wp thead th { text-align: left; padding: 8px 12px; color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-subtle); vertical-align: bottom; }
  .wp thead th.num { text-align: right; }
  .wp thead th.center { text-align: center; }
  .wp tbody td { padding: 9px 12px; vertical-align: middle; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .wp tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .wp tbody tr:hover { background: var(--bg-subtle); }
  .wp tbody tr.group td { padding: 12px 12px 4px; border-bottom: 0; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-tertiary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .wp tbody tr.totals td { padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-bottom: 0; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; background: var(--bg-subtle); }
  .wp tbody tr.totals td.num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 13px; }
  .wp td.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text); }
  .wp td.num.dim { color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .wp td.ref { font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
  .wp td.metric { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
  .wp td.metric .sub { display: block; font-weight: 400; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-top: 2px; font-style: normal; }
  .wp td.title-cell a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; }
  .wp td.title-cell a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
  .wp td.note { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-tertiary); letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 500; }
  .wp td.center { text-align: center; }

  .mark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .mark .dot { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .mark .dot.red    { background: #b91c1c; }
  .mark .dot.orange { background: #c2410c; }
  .mark .dot.amber  { background: #b45309; }
  .mark .dot.green  { background: #166534; }
  .mark .dot.grey   { background: transparent; border: 1.5px solid var(--text-tertiary); }
  .mark .dot.hollow { background: transparent; border: 1.5px solid var(--text-secondary); }
  .mark .lbl { color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 500; font-size: 11px; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .mark.subdued .lbl, .mark.subdued { color: var(--text-tertiary); font-weight: 500; }

  .footref { font-size: 9.5px; vertical-align: super; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; margin-left: 2px; line-height: 0; }

  .pack-verdict { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: 22px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 22px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); margin-bottom: 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
  .pack-verdict .stamp { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; color: var(--text); padding-right: 22px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .pack-verdict .stamp .label { display: block; font-family: sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .pack-verdict .stamp .word { color: var(--text); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .pack-verdict .stamp .word::before { content: ''; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--text-tertiary); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .pack-verdict.go .stamp .word { color: #166534; }
  .pack-verdict.go .stamp .word::before { background: #166534; }
  .pack-verdict.caution .stamp .word { color: #b45309; }
  .pack-verdict.caution .stamp .word::before { background: #b45309; }
  .pack-verdict.stop .stamp .word { color: #b91c1c; }
  .pack-verdict.stop .stamp .word::before { background: #b91c1c; }
  .pack-verdict .narrative { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-secondary); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .pack-verdict .countdown { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .pack-verdict .countdown .n { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); display: block; line-height: 1; }
  .pack-verdict .countdown .lbl { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-tertiary); font-weight: 500; margin-top: 4px; display: block; }

  .rd-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .rd-kpi { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
  .rd-kpi .k-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rd-kpi .k-val { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.3px; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
  .rd-kpi .k-val::before { content: ''; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; display: none; }
  .rd-kpi.is-dot .k-val::before { display: inline-block; background: var(--text-tertiary); }
  .rd-kpi.ok .k-val { color: #166534; } .rd-kpi.ok.is-dot .k-val::before { background: #166534; }
  .rd-kpi.warn .k-val { color: #b45309; } .rd-kpi.warn.is-dot .k-val::before { background: #b45309; }
  .rd-kpi.bad .k-val { color: #b91c1c; } .rd-kpi.bad.is-dot .k-val::before { background: #b91c1c; }
  .rd-kpi .k-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-top: 6px; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .rd-kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

  .pack-appendix { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  details.pack-appendix > summary { margin: -18px -20px 0; padding: 16px 20px; }
  details.pack-appendix[open] > summary { margin-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .pack-appendix-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .pack-appendix-eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--bg-muted); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .pack-appendix-title { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.2px; color: var(--text); margin: 0; flex: 1; }
  .pack-appendix-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-tertiary); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }
  .pack-appendix-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
  .pack-appendix-grid > * { min-width: 0; }
  .pack-appendix .wp td.numref { width: 28px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .pack-appendix .wp td.term { width: 200px; vertical-align: top; padding-top: 9px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .pack-appendix .wp td.term .meta { display: block; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-tertiary); letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; margin-top: 3px; }
  .pack-appendix .wp td.def { vertical-align: top; padding-top: 9px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 12px; }
  .pack-appendix .wp td.def code { font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; background: var(--bg-muted); color: var(--text); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .pack-appendix .pack-caption { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .pack-verdict { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .pack-verdict .stamp {
      padding-right: 0; padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .wp thead th,
    .wp tbody tr.group td,
    .wp td.note,
    .footref,
    .pack-verdict .stamp .label,
    .pack-verdict .countdown .lbl,
    .pack-appendix-eyebrow,
    .pack-appendix .wp td.term .meta
    { font-size: 11px; }
  }
</style>

<%
  const today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);
  const clientName = ws.brand_display_name || ws.client_name;
  const docId = 'ISMS-CRR-' + String(ws.id).padStart(4, '0') + '-' + today.replace(/-/g, '');

  const stage1Pass = !!r.stage1Ready;
  const stage2Pass = !!r.stage2Ready;
  const highFlags = r.flags.filter(f => f.severity === 'high').length;
  const medFlags  = r.flags.filter(f => f.severity === 'medium').length;
  let verdict, verdictWord, narrative;
  if (stage2Pass) {
    verdict = 'go'; verdictWord = 'Audit-ready';
    narrative = 'Both Layer 1 hard gates pass and maturity clears the Stage 2 floor (75%, no control at 0/1). The ISMS is positioned to enter the certification audit.';
  } else if (stage1Pass) {
    verdict = 'caution'; verdictWord = 'Stage 1 ready';
    narrative = 'The Stage 1 hard gate is clear and maturity meets the 60% floor. Close the Stage 2 hard-gate items and lift maturity to 75% before a Stage 2 visit.';
  } else if (r.stage1GateClear && !r.stage1MaturityOk) {
    verdict = 'caution'; verdictWord = 'In progress';
    narrative = 'Every Stage 1 hard-gate item passes but average control maturity (' + r.maturityPct + '%) is below the 60% Stage 1 floor; aggregated minors risk escalating to a major. Lift maturity before booking Stage 1.';
  } else {
    verdict = 'stop'; verdictWord = 'Not ready';
    narrative = (r.stage1GateTotal - r.stage1GatePassed) + ' of ' + r.stage1GateTotal + ' Stage 1 hard-gate items are still failing. Any single Layer 1 failure blocks readiness regardless of maturity (ISO/IEC 17021-1 §9.5.2).';
  }

  const scorecard = [
    { metric: 'Stage 1 verdict',          sub: 'Layer 1 hard gate + 60% maturity floor', current: r.stage1Ready ? 'Ready' : 'Not ready',     target: 'Ready',  pass: stage1Pass,                              dot: stage1Pass ? 'green' : 'red' },
    { metric: 'Stage 2 verdict',          sub: 'Layer 1 hard gate + 75% maturity floor', current: r.stage2Ready ? 'Ready' : 'Not ready',     target: 'Ready',  pass: stage2Pass,                              dot: stage2Pass ? 'green' : (r.stage1Ready ? 'amber' : 'red') },
    { metric: 'Stage 1 hard gate',        sub: '17 boolean prerequisites',               current: r.stage1GatePassed + ' of ' + r.stage1GateTotal, target: 'All', pass: r.stage1GateClear,                  dot: r.stage1GateClear ? 'green' : 'red' },
    { metric: 'Stage 2 hard gate',        sub: '9 operational prerequisites',            current: r.stage2GatePassed + ' of ' + r.stage2GateTotal, target: 'All', pass: r.stage2GateClear,                  dot: r.stage2GateClear ? 'green' : 'amber' },
    { metric: 'Control maturity (Layer 2)', sub: '0-5 avg across applicable Annex A',     current: r.maturityPct + '%',                       target: '≥ 60% / 75%', pass: r.maturityPct >= 60,             dot: r.maturityPct >= 75 ? 'green' : (r.maturityPct >= 60 ? 'amber' : 'red') },
    { metric: 'Mandatory documented information', sub: 'Required by Clauses 4–10',       current: r.records.mandatory.found + ' of ' + r.records.mandatory.total, target: 'Complete', pass: r.records.mandatory.found === r.records.mandatory.total, dot: r.records.mandatory.found === r.records.mandatory.total ? 'green' : (r.records.mandatory.found >= r.records.mandatory.total - 2 ? 'amber' : 'red') },
    { metric: 'Control implementation',   sub: 'Implemented or N/A on the SoA',          current: ((r.metrics.implemented + r.metrics.na) + ' of ' + r.metrics.totalItems), target: '≥ 80%', pass: r.metrics.totalItems > 0 && ((r.metrics.implemented + r.metrics.na) / r.metrics.totalItems) >= 0.8, dot: r.metrics.totalItems > 0 && ((r.metrics.implemented + r.metrics.na) / r.metrics.totalItems) >= 0.8 ? 'green' : 'amber' },
    { metric: 'Average control maturity', sub: 'Self-rated, 0–5 scale',                  current: r.metrics.avgMaturity + ' / 5',            target: '≥ 3.0',  pass: parseFloat(r.metrics.avgMaturity) >= 3.0, dot: parseFloat(r.metrics.avgMaturity) >= 3.0 ? 'green' : (parseFloat(r.metrics.avgMaturity) >= 2.0 ? 'amber' : 'red') },
    { metric: 'High-severity observations', sub: 'Section 2 below',                      current: String(highFlags),                          target: '0',      pass: highFlags === 0,                          dot: highFlags === 0 ? 'green' : 'red' },
    { metric: 'Medium-severity observations', sub: 'Section 2 below',                    current: String(medFlags),                           target: '≤ 3',    pass: medFlags <= 3,                            dot: medFlags <= 3 ? 'green' : 'amber' },
    { metric: 'Evidence files on file',   sub: 'Across all control items',               current: String(r.metrics.evidenceCount),            target: '≥ ' + Math.round(r.metrics.totalItems * 0.6), pass: r.metrics.evidenceCount >= r.metrics.totalItems * 0.6, dot: r.metrics.evidenceCount >= r.metrics.totalItems * 0.6 ? 'green' : (r.metrics.evidenceCount >= r.metrics.totalItems * 0.3 ? 'amber' : 'red') }
  ];

  const flagsHigh   = r.flags.filter(f => f.severity === 'high');
  const flagsMedium = r.flags.filter(f => f.severity === 'medium');
  const flagsLow    = r.flags.filter(f => f.severity !== 'high' && f.severity !== 'medium');

  const flagDotFor = (sev) => sev === 'high' ? 'red' : sev === 'medium' ? 'amber' : 'grey';
  const sevLabel   = (sev) => sev === 'high' ? 'High' : sev === 'medium' ? 'Medium' : 'Low';

  const totalControls = r.metrics.totalItems || 0;
  const cpct = (n) => totalControls > 0 ? Math.round((n / totalControls) * 100) : 0;
  const CTRL_ROWS = [
    { label: 'Implemented',          sub: 'Counts toward audit-ready coverage',                count: r.metrics.implemented, dot: 'green',  evidence: 'Yes, when evidenced' },
    { label: 'Partially Implemented', sub: 'Coverage gap on existing control',                 count: r.metrics.partial,     dot: 'amber',  evidence: 'No' },
    { label: 'Work In Progress',     sub: 'Implementation under way',                          count: r.metrics.wip,         dot: 'orange', evidence: 'No' },
    { label: 'Not Implemented',      sub: 'Absent: gap requiring action',                     count: r.metrics.notImpl,     dot: 'red',    evidence: 'No' },
    { label: 'Not Applicable',       sub: 'Excluded with documented justification',            count: r.metrics.na,          dot: 'hollow', evidence: 'N/A' }
  ];

  const dtColor = r.daysToTarget === null ? 'var(--text-tertiary)'
                : r.daysToTarget < 30  ? '#b91c1c'
                : r.daysToTarget < 90  ? '#c2410c'
                : 'var(--text)';
%>

<div class="pack">

  <div class="pack-title">
    <div>
      <div class="pack-title-eyebrow"><%= clientName %> · ISO/IEC 27001:2022</div>
      <h1>Certification readiness
        <span class="sub">Stage-gate verdict, observations, and documented-information posture · as at <%= today %></span>
      </h1>
    </div>
    <div class="pack-actions">
      <a href="/workspaces/<%= ws.id %>/readiness/blockers" class="btn btn-primary btn-xs">Pre-cert blockers →</a>
      <a href="/workspaces/<%= ws.id %>/controls/assess/summary" class="btn btn-secondary btn-xs">Gap findings →</a>
      <a href="/workspaces/<%= ws.id %>/audits" class="btn btn-secondary btn-xs">Open audit log →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="callout" style="margin:0 0 18px">
    <strong>Compliance Sphere ISO 27001 Readiness Method v2026.1.</strong>
    This is a proprietary consulting decision aid. Its stage gates and maturity thresholds are not an ISO score and do not replace a certification body's audit decision.
  </div>

  <div class="pack-body">

    <div class="rd-kpis">
      <div class="rd-kpi is-dot <%= r.stage1Ready ? 'ok' : 'bad' %>">
        <div class="k-label">Stage 1 verdict</div>
        <div class="k-val"><%= r.stage1Ready ? 'Ready' : 'Not ready' %></div>
        <div class="k-sub"><%= r.stage1GatePassed %>/<%= r.stage1GateTotal %> hard gate · maturity <%= r.maturityPct %>%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rd-kpi is-dot <%= r.stage2Ready ? 'ok' : (r.stage1Ready ? 'warn' : 'bad') %>">
        <div class="k-label">Stage 2 verdict</div>
        <div class="k-val"><%= r.stage2Ready ? 'Ready' : 'Not ready' %></div>
        <div class="k-sub"><%= r.stage2GatePassed %>/<%= r.stage2GateTotal %> hard gate · floor 75%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rd-kpi <%= r.maturityPct >= 75 ? 'ok' : (r.maturityPct >= 60 ? 'warn' : 'bad') %>">
        <div class="k-label">Control maturity</div>
        <div class="k-val"><%= r.maturityPct %>%</div>
        <div class="k-sub">0-5 avg across <%= r.applicableControls %> applicable controls</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rd-kpi <%= r.daysToTarget !== null && r.daysToTarget < 30 ? 'bad' : (r.daysToTarget !== null && r.daysToTarget < 90 ? 'warn' : '') %>">
        <div class="k-label">Days to target cert</div>
        <div class="k-val"><%= r.daysToTarget !== null ? r.daysToTarget : '-' %></div>
        <div class="k-sub"><%= ws.target_cert_date || 'No target date set' %></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pack-verdict <%= verdict %>">
      <div class="stamp">
        <span class="label">Reviewer verdict</span>
        <span class="word"><%= verdictWord %></span>
      </div>
      <div class="narrative"><%= narrative %></div>
      <% if (r.daysToTarget !== null) { %>
        <div class="countdown">
          <span class="n" style="color:<%= dtColor %>;"><%= r.daysToTarget %></span>
          <span class="lbl">days to <%= ws.target_cert_date %></span>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="countdown">
          <span class="n" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:18px;">-</span>
          <span class="lbl">No target date set</span>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <%
      const renderStatsPanel = () => {
        const sc = r.statusCounts || { impl:0, partial:0, wip:0, notImpl:0, na:0, notAss:0 };
        const total = r.totalSoaItems || 0;
        const assessed = r.totalAssessed || 0;
        const assessedPct = total ? Math.round(assessed / total * 100) : 0;
        const implPct = total ? Math.round(sc.impl / total * 100) : 0;
        const seg = [
          { v: sc.impl,    color: '#15803d', label: 'Implemented' },
          { v: sc.partial, color: '#b45309', label: 'Partially' },
          { v: sc.wip,     color: '#0891b2', label: 'In progress' },
          { v: sc.notImpl, color: '#b91c1c', label: 'Not implemented' },
          { v: sc.na,      color: '#8a8a87', label: 'Not applicable' },
          { v: sc.notAss,  color: '#e5e3dc', label: 'Not assessed' }
        ].filter(s => s.v > 0);
        const themesObj = r.themes || {};

        let html = '<div style="border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fafaf8;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px;">';

        html += '<div>'
              + '<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:4px;">'
              + '<div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-tertiary);">Gap assessment</div>'
              + '<div class="num" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">' + assessed + '</span> of ' + total + ' assessed · ' + assessedPct + '%</div>'
              + '</div>'
              + '<div style="display:flex;height:8px;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-muted);">';
        if (assessed > 0) html += '<span style="background:#1a1a1a;width:' + (total ? (assessed/total*100).toFixed(2) : 0) + '%;"></span>';
        html += '</div>';
        html += '<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">';
        Object.values(themesObj).forEach(t => {
          const pct = t.total ? Math.round(t.assessed / t.total * 100) : 0;
          html += '<div>'
                + '<div style="font-size:9.5px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-bottom:2px;letter-spacing:0.2px;">' + t.label + '</div>'
                + '<div class="num" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">' + t.assessed + '<span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-weight:400;">/' + t.total + '</span></div>'
                + '<div style="height:3px;background:var(--bg-muted);border-radius:1px;margin-top:3px;overflow:hidden;"><div style="height:100%;background:#1a1a1a;width:' + pct + '%;"></div></div>'
                + '</div>';
        });
        html += '</div></div>';

        html += '<div>'
              + '<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:4px;">'
              + '<div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-tertiary);">Implementation</div>'
              + '<div class="num" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);"><span style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">' + sc.impl + '</span> of ' + total + ' implemented · ' + implPct + '%</div>'
              + '</div>'
              + '<div style="display:flex;height:8px;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-muted);">';
        seg.forEach(s => {
          html += '<span title="' + s.label + ': ' + s.v + '" style="background:' + s.color + ';width:' + (total ? (s.v/total*100).toFixed(2) : 0) + '%;"></span>';
        });
        html += '</div>';
        html += '<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 12px;margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-tertiary);">';
        seg.forEach(s => {
          html += '<span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;">'
                + '<span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:' + s.color + ';display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;"></span>'
                + s.label + ' <span class="num" style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">' + s.v + '</span>'
                + '</span>';
        });
        html += '</div>';
        html += '<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">';
        Object.values(themesObj).forEach(t => {
          const pct = t.total ? Math.round(t.implemented / t.total * 100) : 0;
          const col = pct >= 80 ? '#15803d' : pct >= 50 ? '#b45309' : pct > 0 ? '#b91c1c' : 'var(--text-tertiary)';
          html += '<div>'
                + '<div style="font-size:9.5px;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-bottom:2px;letter-spacing:0.2px;">' + t.label + '</div>'
                + '<div class="num" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text);font-weight:500;">' + t.implemented + '<span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-weight:400;">/' + t.total + '</span></div>'
                + '<div style="height:3px;background:var(--bg-muted);border-radius:1px;margin-top:3px;overflow:hidden;"><div style="height:100%;background:' + col + ';width:' + pct + '%;"></div></div>'
                + '</div>';
        });
        html += '</div></div>';

        html += '</div>';
        return html;
      };

      const renderBreakdownTable = (breakdown, totalScore) => {
        let html = '<table class="wp"><thead><tr>'
                 + '<th style="width:30%;">Input</th>'
                 + '<th class="num">Weight</th>'
                 + '<th class="num">Earned</th>'
                 + '<th class="num">On the table</th>'
                 + '<th>Status &amp; what to do</th>'
                 + '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        breakdown.forEach(b => {
          const ringCol = b.score >= 0.99 ? '#166534' : b.score >= 0.5 ? '#92400e' : '#b91c1c';
          html += '<tr>'
            + '<td class="metric">' + b.label + '<span class="sub">' + b.detail + '</span></td>'
            + '<td class="num">' + Math.round(b.weight * 100) + '%</td>'
            + '<td class="num">' + b.earned.toFixed(1) + '</td>'
            + '<td class="num dim">' + (b.remaining > 0 ? '+' + b.remaining.toFixed(1) : '–') + '</td>'
            + '<td><span class="mark"><span class="dot" style="background:' + ringCol + ';"></span>'
            + '<span class="lbl">' + b.hint + '</span></span></td>'
            + '</tr>';
        });
        html += '<tr class="totals">'
              + '<td>Readiness</td>'
              + '<td class="num">100%</td>'
              + '<td class="num">' + totalScore.toFixed(1) + '</td>'
              + '<td class="num">' + (100 - totalScore).toFixed(1) + '</td>'
              + '<td></td>'
              + '</tr></tbody></table>';
        return html;
      };

      const renderIssuesTable = (breakdown, stageLabel) => {
        const allFlags = (r.flags || []).slice().sort((a, b) =>
          (a.severity === 'high' ? 0 : 1) - (b.severity === 'high' ? 0 : 1)
        );
        if (!allFlags.length) {
          return '<div class="pack-empty" style="padding: 18px 14px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-tertiary); font-style: italic; font-size: 12.5px; border-top: 2px solid var(--text); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text);">No issues open. All detection rules pass.</div>';
        }
        const flagsRow = breakdown.find(b => b.key === 'flags');
        const perHighFlag = flagsRow ? Math.round((flagsRow.ceiling / 5) * 10) / 10 : 3;
        const highCount = allFlags.filter(f => f.severity === 'high').length;
        let html = '<table class="wp"><thead><tr>'
                 + '<th style="width:30px;">#</th>'
                 + '<th style="width:80px;">Severity</th>'
                 + '<th>Issue</th>'
                 + '<th>Sampled affected items</th>'
                 + '<th class="num" style="width:120px;">' + stageLabel + ' impact</th>'
                 + '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        allFlags.forEach((f, i) => {
          const items = (f.items || []).slice(0, 3).map(it => it.title).join(' · ');
          const more = Math.max(0, (f.items || []).length - 3);
          const itemCell = items || '<span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-style:italic;">no sample items</span>';
          const sevColor = f.severity === 'high' ? '#b91c1c' : '#a16207';
          const sevLabel = f.severity === 'high' ? 'High' : 'Medium';
          const impactCell = f.severity === 'high'
            ? '+' + perHighFlag.toFixed(1) + ' pts'
            : '<span class="dim" style="color:var(--text-tertiary);">no score impact</span>';
          html += '<tr>'
            + '<td class="num dim">' + (i + 1) + '</td>'
            + '<td><span class="mark"><span class="dot" style="background:' + sevColor + ';"></span><span class="lbl">' + sevLabel + '</span></span></td>'
            + '<td class="metric">' + f.label + '</td>'
            + '<td style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);">' + itemCell
            + (more > 0 ? ' <span class="meta">+ ' + more + ' more</span>' : '') + '</td>'
            + '<td class="num">' + impactCell + '</td>'
            + '</tr>';
        });
        html += '<tr class="totals">'
              + '<td></td>'
              + '<td colspan="2">Close all high-severity issues (' + highCount + ')</td>'
              + '<td></td>'
              + '<td class="num">+' + (perHighFlag * highCount).toFixed(1) + ' pts</td>'
              + '</tr></tbody></table>';
        return html;
      };
    %>

    <%
      const passDot = '<span class="mark"><span class="dot green"></span><span class="lbl">Pass</span></span>';
      const failDot = '<span class="mark"><span class="dot red"></span><span class="lbl">Fail</span></span>';

      const renderChecklistTable = (rows, totalPassed, totalCount) => {
        let html = '<table class="wp"><thead><tr>'
                 + '<th style="width:30px;">#</th>'
                 + '<th style="width:130px;">ISO ref</th>'
                 + '<th>Prerequisite</th>'
                 + '<th>Status</th>'
                 + '<th class="center" style="width:90px;">Check</th>'
                 + '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        rows.forEach((c, i) => {
          const dot = c.pass ? passDot : failDot;
          const action = c.pass
            ? '<span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-style:italic;">' + c.detail + '</span>'
            : c.detail + ' · <a href="' + c.href + '" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;">' + c.action + '</a>';
          html += '<tr>'
                + '<td class="num dim">' + (i + 1) + '</td>'
                + '<td class="ref">' + c.clause + '</td>'
                + '<td class="metric">' + c.name + '</td>'
                + '<td style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);">' + action + '</td>'
                + '<td class="center">' + dot + '</td>'
                + '</tr>';
        });
        html += '<tr class="totals">'
              + '<td></td><td></td>'
              + '<td>Mandatory prerequisites passed</td>'
              + '<td></td>'
              + '<td class="center"><span class="num">' + totalPassed + ' / ' + totalCount + '</span></td>'
              + '</tr></tbody></table>';
        return html;
      };

      const renderSignalsTable = (rows) => {
        const passed = rows.filter(c => c.pass).length;
        let html = '<table class="wp"><thead><tr>'
                 + '<th style="width:30px;">#</th>'
                 + '<th>Signal</th>'
                 + '<th>Status</th>'
                 + '<th class="center" style="width:90px;">Check</th>'
                 + '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        rows.forEach((c, i) => {
          const dot = c.pass ? passDot : '<span class="mark"><span class="dot amber"></span><span class="lbl">Not yet</span></span>';
          const action = '<a href="' + c.href + '" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--border);">' + c.detail + '</a>';
          html += '<tr>'
                + '<td class="num dim">' + (i + 1) + '</td>'
                + '<td class="metric">' + c.name + '</td>'
                + '<td style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);">' + action + '</td>'
                + '<td class="center">' + dot + '</td>'
                + '</tr>';
        });
        html += '<tr class="totals">'
              + '<td></td>'
              + '<td>Operational quality signals on track</td>'
              + '<td></td>'
              + '<td class="center"><span class="num">' + passed + ' / ' + rows.length + '</span></td>'
              + '</tr></tbody></table>';
        return html;
      };
    %>

    <%
      const renderGateTable = (rows, passed, total) => {
        let html = '<table class="wp"><thead><tr>'
                 + '<th style="width:30px;">#</th>'
                 + '<th style="width:130px;">ISO ref</th>'
                 + '<th>Hard-gate requirement</th>'
                 + '<th>Status</th>'
                 + '<th class="center" style="width:80px;">Gate</th>'
                 + '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        rows.forEach((c, i) => {
          const dot = c.pass ? passDot : failDot;
          const status = c.pass
            ? '<span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);">' + c.detail + '</span>'
            : c.detail + (c.action ? ' · <a href="' + c.href + '" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;">' + c.action + '</a>' : '');
          const nameCell = c.href
            ? '<a href="' + c.href + '" style="color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;" onmouseover="this.style.borderBottomColor=\'var(--accent)\'" onmouseout="this.style.borderBottomColor=\'transparent\'">' + c.name + '</a>'
            : c.name;
          html += '<tr>'
                + '<td class="num dim">' + (i + 1) + '</td>'
                + '<td class="ref">' + c.clause + '</td>'
                + '<td class="metric">' + nameCell + '</td>'
                + '<td style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);">' + status + '</td>'
                + '<td class="center">' + dot + '</td>'
                + '</tr>';
        });
        html += '<tr class="totals">'
              + '<td></td><td></td>'
              + '<td>Hard-gate items passing</td><td></td>'
              + '<td class="center"><span class="num">' + passed + ' / ' + total + '</span></td>'
              + '</tr></tbody></table>';
        return html;
      };

      const verdictBanner = (ready, gateClear, matOk, matPct, floor, gatePassed, gateTotal) => {
        const dot = (c) => '<span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:' + c + ';display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:5px;"></span>';
        if (ready) {
          return '<div style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;">'
               + dot('#166534')
               + '<div><span style="color:#166534;font-weight:500;">Ready.</span> <span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">All ' + gateTotal + ' hard-gate items pass and maturity is ' + matPct + '% (floor ' + floor + '%). No Layer 1 blocker remains.</span></div>'
               + '</div>';
        }
        const reasons = [];
        if (!gateClear) reasons.push((gateTotal - gatePassed) + ' hard-gate item' + ((gateTotal - gatePassed) === 1 ? '' : 's') + ' failing');
        if (!matOk) reasons.push('maturity ' + matPct + '% below the ' + floor + '% floor');
        return '<div style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;">'
             + dot('#b91c1c')
             + '<div><span style="color:#b91c1c;font-weight:500;">Not ready</span> <span style="color:var(--text);">' + reasons.join(' · ') + '.</span> <span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);">Any single Layer 1 failure blocks readiness regardless of the maturity score (ISO/IEC 17021-1 §9.5.2).</span></div>'
             + '</div>';
      };
    %>

    <div class="pack-section">
      <div class="pack-section-head">
        <span class="pack-section-num">1</span>
        <h2 class="pack-section-title">Stage 1: design &amp; documentation</h2>
        <span class="pack-section-meta">verdict: <%= r.stage1Ready ? 'Ready' : 'Not ready' %> · maturity <%= r.maturityPct %>%</span>
      </div>

      <%- verdictBanner(r.stage1Ready, r.stage1GateClear, r.stage1MaturityOk, r.maturityPct, 60, r.stage1GatePassed, r.stage1GateTotal) %>

      <div class="pack-caption"><span>Layer 1: hard gate</span><span class="label">17 items · any FAIL = Not ready</span></div>
      <%- renderGateTable(r.stage1Gate || [], r.stage1GatePassed, r.stage1GateTotal) %>
      <div class="pack-source"><strong>Methodology</strong> Boolean presence + substantive-compliance checks drawn from the documented-information requirements of clauses 4-10 and the procedural requirements of §9.2/§9.3. Mirrors 17021-1 §9.5.2: certification cannot be granted while any major nonconformity remains.</div>

      <div class="pack-caption" style="margin-top:22px;"><span>Layer 2: maturity</span><span class="label">0-5 averaged across applicable Annex A controls</span></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fafaf8;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center;">
        <div style="text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--border);padding-right:20px;">
          <div class="num" style="font-size:34px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;color:<%= r.maturityPct >= 60 ? '#166534' : '#b91c1c' %>;"><%= r.maturityPct %>%</div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:6px;">Stage 1 floor 60%</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-secondary);">
          Average advisory capability across <strong style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;"><%= r.applicableControls %></strong> applicable Annex A controls, using the Nimbus proprietary 0-5 method.
          <% if (r.maturityPct < 60) { %><br><span style="color:#b91c1c;">Below the 60% Stage 1 floor; aggregated minor nonconformities risk escalating to major (§3.12 Note 1).</span><% } else { %><br>Meets the 60% Stage 1 floor.<% } %>
          Unassessed applicable controls count as 0. Set per-control maturity in the gap-assessment wizard.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pack-source"><strong>How read</strong> Layer 2 informs but never overrides Layer 1. A high maturity % with a failing hard-gate item is still Not ready.</div>

      <div class="pack-caption" style="margin-top:22px;"><span>Gap assessment + implementation snapshot</span><span class="label">SoA state context</span></div>
      <%- renderStatsPanel() %>
    </div>

    <div class="pack-section">
      <div class="pack-section-head">
        <span class="pack-section-num">2</span>
        <h2 class="pack-section-title">Stage 2: implementation &amp; effectiveness</h2>
        <span class="pack-section-meta">verdict: <%= r.stage2Ready ? 'Ready' : 'Not ready' %> · maturity <%= r.maturityPct %>%</span>
      </div>

      <% if (!r.stage1Ready) { %>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;">
          <span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#b45309;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:5px;"></span>
          <div><span style="color:#b45309;font-weight:500;">Gated.</span> <span style="color:var(--text-secondary);">Stage 2 cannot be reached until Stage 1 is Ready. Clear the Stage 1 hard gate first; the Stage 2 gate below is shown for forward planning.</span></div>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <%- verdictBanner(r.stage2Ready, r.stage2GateClear, r.stage2MaturityOk, r.maturityPct, 75, r.stage2GatePassed, r.stage2GateTotal) %>
      <% } %>

      <div class="pack-caption"><span>Layer 1: hard gate</span><span class="label">9 items · requires Stage 1 Ready first</span></div>
      <%- renderGateTable(r.stage2Gate || [], r.stage2GatePassed, r.stage2GateTotal) %>
      <div class="pack-source"><strong>Methodology</strong> Stage 2 evaluates implementation + effectiveness (17021-1 §9.3.1.3): operating records, ≥2 evidence samples per applicable control, monitoring outputs, a closed internal-audit cycle, a recent MRM, root-cause + effectiveness in the NC register, legal register current, and BCP + IR tests performed.</div>

      <div class="pack-caption" style="margin-top:22px;"><span>Layer 2: maturity</span><span class="label">Floor 75% · no control at 0 or 1</span></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);background:#fafaf8;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center;">
        <div style="text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--border);padding-right:20px;">
          <div class="num" style="font-size:34px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;color:<%= (r.maturityPct >= 75 && r.controlsAtZeroOrOne === 0) ? '#166534' : '#b91c1c' %>;"><%= r.maturityPct %>%</div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-top:6px;">Stage 2 floor 75%</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-secondary);">
          <% if (r.maturityPct < 75) { %><span style="color:#b91c1c;">Maturity <%= r.maturityPct %>% is below the 75% Stage 2 floor.</span>
          <% } else if (r.controlsAtZeroOrOne > 0) { %><span style="color:#b91c1c;"><%= r.controlsAtZeroOrOne %> applicable control<%= r.controlsAtZeroOrOne === 1 ? ' is' : 's are' %> still at maturity 0 or 1; Stage 2 requires every applicable control at ≥ 2.</span>
          <% } else { %>Meets the 75% floor with no applicable control at 0 or 1.<% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="border-top:2px solid var(--text);padding-top:14px;margin-top:14px;margin-bottom:18px;">
      <div class="pack-caption" style="margin-bottom:0;"><span>Drill-down detail</span><span class="label">Click any section below to expand</span></div>
    </div>

    <details class="pack-section" id="sec-scorecard">
      <summary class="pack-section-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;">
        <span class="pack-section-num" style="opacity:0.55;">▸</span>
        <h2 class="pack-section-title">Stage-gate scorecard</h2>
        <span class="pack-section-meta">8 metrics · click to expand</span>
      </summary>
      <div style="padding-top:14px;">
        <div class="pack-caption"><span>Posture against Stage 1 and Stage 2 gate criteria</span><span class="label">All thresholds</span></div>
        <table class="wp">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width:30px;"></th>
              <th>Metric</th>
              <th class="num" style="width:130px;">Current</th>
              <th class="num" style="width:90px;">Threshold</th>
              <th class="center" style="width:100px;">Status</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% scorecard.forEach(row => { %>
              <tr>
                <td class="center"><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= row.dot %>"></span></span></td>
                <td class="metric"><%= row.metric %><span class="sub"><%= row.sub %></span></td>
                <td class="num"><%= row.current %></td>
                <td class="num dim"><%= row.target %></td>
                <td class="center"><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= row.pass ? 'green' : 'red' %>"></span><span class="lbl"><%= row.pass ? 'Pass' : 'Fail' %></span></span></td>
              </tr>
            <% }) %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="pack-source"><strong>Source</strong> Computed live from <code style="background:rgba(92,10,10,0.05);color:var(--accent);padding:1px 5px;font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;">computeReadiness(ws)</code>. Formula weights + pass thresholds are in the Methodology block at the bottom.</div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="pack-section" id="sec-observations">
      <summary class="pack-section-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;">
        <span class="pack-section-num" style="opacity:0.55;">▸</span>
        <h2 class="pack-section-title">Open observations &amp; detected gaps</h2>
        <span class="pack-section-meta"><%= r.flags.length %> open · click to expand</span>
      </summary>
      <div style="padding-top:14px;">
      <% if (r.flags.length === 0) { %>
        <div class="pack-empty" style="padding: 18px 14px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-tertiary); font-style: italic; font-size: 12.5px; border-top: 2px solid var(--text); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text);">No observations open. Readiness posture is clean across all detection rules.</div>
      <% } else {
           const renderFlagRow = (f, idx) => {
             const sample = (f.items || []).slice(0, 3).map(it => it.title).join(' · ');
             return { f, idx, sample, more: Math.max(0, (f.items || []).length - 3) };
           };
      %>
        <div class="pack-caption"><span>Exhibit 2.1 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Open observations requiring remediation before audit</span><span class="label"><%= r.flags.length %> rows</span></div>
        <table class="wp">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width:32px;" class="center">#</th>
              <th style="width:95px;">Severity</th>
              <th>Observation</th>
              <th>Sampled items</th>
              <th class="num" style="width:70px;">Count</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <% let rowNum = 0; %>
            <% if (flagsHigh.length) { %>
              <tr class="group"><td colspan="5">High severity: will be cited as a nonconformity (<%= flagsHigh.length %>)</td></tr>
              <% flagsHigh.forEach(f => { rowNum++; const r = renderFlagRow(f, rowNum); %>
                <tr>
                  <td class="center" style="font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight: 500;"><%= rowNum %></td>
                  <td><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= flagDotFor(f.severity) %>"></span><span class="lbl"><%= sevLabel(f.severity) %></span></span></td>
                  <td style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;"><%= f.label.replace(/^\d+\s+/, '') %></td>
                  <td style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-style:italic;line-height:1.5;"><% if (r.sample) { %><%= r.sample %><% if (r.more) { %> &middot; +<%= r.more %> more<% } %><% } else { %>-<% } %></td>
                  <td class="num"><%= (f.items || []).length || '-' %></td>
                </tr>
              <% }) %>
            <% } %>
            <% if (flagsMedium.length) { %>
              <tr class="group"><td colspan="5">Medium severity: tighten before Stage 2 (<%= flagsMedium.length %>)</td></tr>
              <% flagsMedium.forEach(f => { rowNum++; const r = renderFlagRow(f, rowNum); %>
                <tr>
                  <td class="center" style="font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight: 500;"><%= rowNum %></td>
                  <td><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= flagDotFor(f.severity) %>"></span><span class="lbl"><%= sevLabel(f.severity) %></span></span></td>
                  <td style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;"><%= f.label.replace(/^\d+\s+/, '') %></td>
                  <td style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-style:italic;line-height:1.5;"><% if (r.sample) { %><%= r.sample %><% if (r.more) { %> &middot; +<%= r.more %> more<% } %><% } else { %>-<% } %></td>
                  <td class="num"><%= (f.items || []).length || '-' %></td>
                </tr>
              <% }) %>
            <% } %>
            <% if (flagsLow.length) { %>
              <tr class="group"><td colspan="5">Low / informational (<%= flagsLow.length %>)</td></tr>
              <% flagsLow.forEach(f => { rowNum++; const r = renderFlagRow(f, rowNum); %>
                <tr>
                  <td class="center" style="font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight: 500;"><%= rowNum %></td>
                  <td><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= flagDotFor(f.severity) %>"></span><span class="lbl"><%= sevLabel(f.severity) %></span></span></td>
                  <td style="color:var(--text);font-weight:500;"><%= f.label.replace(/^\d+\s+/, '') %></td>
                  <td style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-tertiary);font-style:italic;line-height:1.5;"><% if (r.sample) { %><%= r.sample %><% if (r.more) { %> &middot; +<%= r.more %> more<% } %><% } else { %>-<% } %></td>
                  <td class="num"><%= (f.items || []).length || '-' %></td>
                </tr>
              <% }) %>
            <% } %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="pack-source"><strong>Source</strong> Each observation is generated by a deterministic rule (e.g. <code style="background:rgba(92,10,10,0.05);color:var(--accent);padding:1px 5px;font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;">implemented_no_evidence</code>). Severity is fixed per rule; <em>Sampled items</em> shows the first three affected records.</div>
      <% } %>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="pack-section">
      <summary class="pack-section-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;">
        <span class="pack-section-num" style="opacity:0.55;">▸</span>
        <h2 class="pack-section-title">Documented-information register</h2>
        <span class="pack-section-meta"><%= r.records.mandatory.found %>/<%= r.records.mandatory.total %> mandatory · <%= r.records.expected.found %>/<%= r.records.expected.total %> expected · click to expand</span>
      </summary>
      <div style="padding-top:14px;">
      <div class="pack-caption"><span>Mandatory records (Clauses 4–10)</span><span class="label"><%= r.records.mandatory.total %> rows</span></div>
      <table class="wp">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:30px;" class="center"></th>
            <th>Record / Item</th>
            <th class="ref" style="width:130px;">ISO reference</th>
            <th class="center" style="width:90px;">Detected</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% r.records.mandatory.checks.forEach(c => { %>
            <tr>
              <td class="center"><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= c.found ? 'green' : 'red' %>"></span></span></td>
              <td class="metric"><%= c.name %></td>
              <td class="ref">Cl. <%= c.clause %></td>
              <td class="center"><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= c.found ? 'green' : 'red' %>"></span><span class="lbl"><%= c.found ? 'Present' : 'Missing' %></span></span></td>
            </tr>
          <% }) %>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="pack-caption" style="margin-top:22px;"><span>Exhibit 3.2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Expected records (required if related Annex A control is included)</span><span class="label"><%= r.records.expected.total %> rows</span></div>
      <table class="wp">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:30px;" class="center"></th>
            <th>Record / Item</th>
            <th class="ref" style="width:130px;">ISO reference</th>
            <th class="center" style="width:90px;">Detected</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% r.records.expected.checks.forEach(c => { %>
            <tr>
              <td class="center"><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= c.found ? 'green' : 'hollow' %>"></span></span></td>
              <td class="metric"><%= c.name %></td>
              <td class="ref"><%= c.clause %></td>
              <td class="center"><span class="mark <%= c.found ? '' : 'subdued' %>"><span class="dot <%= c.found ? 'green' : 'hollow' %>"></span><span class="lbl"><%= c.found ? 'Present' : 'Not detected' %></span></span></td>
            </tr>
          <% }) %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="pack-source"><strong>Caveat</strong> Detection is heuristic: based on document type, naming patterns, and presence of linked records. Mark a record as present in the underlying register if the heuristic misses it.</div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="pack-section">
      <summary class="pack-section-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;">
        <span class="pack-section-num" style="opacity:0.55;">▸</span>
        <h2 class="pack-section-title">Control implementation distribution</h2>
        <span class="pack-section-meta"><%= totalControls %> items · click to expand</span>
      </summary>
      <div style="padding-top:14px;">
      <div class="pack-caption"><span>Exhibit 4.1 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Posture of every control on the SoA</span><span class="label">All counts</span></div>
      <table class="wp">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:30px;"></th>
            <th>Status</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:90px;">Count</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:90px;">% of total</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:170px;">Evidence-ready?</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% CTRL_ROWS.forEach(row => { %>
            <tr>
              <td class="center"><span class="mark"><span class="dot <%= row.dot %>"></span></span></td>
              <td class="metric"><%= row.label %><span class="sub"><%= row.sub %></span></td>
              <td class="num"><%= row.count %></td>
              <td class="num dim"><%= cpct(row.count) %>%</td>
              <td class="num dim" style="font-family:inherit;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.02em;text-align:right;"><%= row.evidence %></td>
            </tr>
          <% }) %>
          <tr class="totals">
            <td></td>
            <td>Total controls on register</td>
            <td class="num"><%= totalControls %></td>
            <td class="num">100%</td>
            <td class="num" style="font-family:inherit;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.02em;font-weight: 500;text-align:right;"><%= r.metrics.evidenceCount %> evidence files</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="pack-source"><strong>Source</strong> <code style="background:rgba(92,10,10,0.05);color:var(--accent);padding:1px 5px;font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;">control_states</code> + <code style="background:rgba(92,10,10,0.05);color:var(--accent);padding:1px 5px;font-family:'SF Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;">evidence</code> tables. Implemented controls without an evidence file appear in the gap-findings pack.</div>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>

  <details class="pack-appendix">
    <summary class="pack-appendix-head" style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;">
      <div class="pack-appendix-eyebrow">App. A</div>
      <h3 class="pack-appendix-title">Methodology · verdict thresholds &amp; scoring formulas</h3>
      <span class="pack-appendix-meta">Click to expand</span>
    </summary>

    <div class="pack-appendix-grid">

      <div>
        <div class="pack-caption"><span>A.1 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Reviewer verdict logic</span><span class="label">3 outcomes</span></div>
        <table class="wp">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="numref">i</td>
              <td class="term"><span class="mark"><span class="dot green"></span><span class="lbl" style="color:#166534;font-weight: 500;">Audit-ready</span></span><span class="meta">All conditions met</span></td>
              <td class="def">Stage 1 &ge; <code>80%</code>, Stage 2 &ge; <code>80%</code>, and zero high-severity observations open. Recommend booking the registrar for Stage 1.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="numref">ii</td>
              <td class="term"><span class="mark"><span class="dot orange"></span><span class="lbl" style="color:#c2410c;font-weight: 500;">Stage 1 ready</span></span><span class="meta">Partial pass</span></td>
              <td class="def">Stage 1 &ge; <code>80%</code> but Stage 2 below threshold, or at most one high-severity observation remains. Stage 1 visit can proceed; close Section 2 items and rebuild operational evidence before Stage 2.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="numref">iii</td>
              <td class="term"><span class="mark"><span class="dot red"></span><span class="lbl" style="color:#b91c1c;font-weight: 500;">Not ready</span></span><span class="meta">Material risk</span></td>
              <td class="def">More than two high-severity observations open, <em>or</em> certification target &lt; 30 days away while Stage 2 below threshold. Reschedule the audit or accelerate remediation.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="numref">iv</td>
              <td class="term">In progress<span class="meta">Default</span></td>
              <td class="def">Used when none of the three definitive verdicts apply. Treat as a work-in-flight status; the scorecard above identifies which gate is the blocker.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="pack-caption"><span>A.2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Stage 1 and Stage 2 score composition</span><span class="label">2 formulas</span></div>
        <table class="wp">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width:32px;" class="center">#</th>
              <th style="width:170px;">Component</th>
              <th class="num" style="width:90px;">Stage 1 weight</th>
              <th class="num" style="width:90px;">Stage 2 weight</th>
              <th>What it measures</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td class="numref" style="font-size:11px;">a</td><td class="term">Mandatory records<span class="meta">Clause 4–10</span></td><td class="num">30%</td><td class="num">20%</td><td class="def">Share of mandatory documented information detected in the workspace (Exhibit 3.1).</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="numref" style="font-size:11px;">b</td><td class="term">Control implementation<span class="meta">Implemented + N/A</span></td><td class="num">35%</td><td class="num">30%</td><td class="def">Share of all controls (clauses + Annex A) where status is Implemented or N/A.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="numref" style="font-size:11px;">c</td><td class="term">High-severity flags<span class="meta">Inverse</span></td><td class="num">15%</td><td class="num">20%</td><td class="def">Penalised at <code>max(0, 1 − highFlags / 5)</code>. Five high-severity flags = zero contribution.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="numref" style="font-size:11px;">d</td><td class="term">Management review<span class="meta">Status = complete</span></td><td class="num">10%</td><td class="num">10%</td><td class="def">At least one MRM marked complete in this workspace.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="numref" style="font-size:11px;">e</td><td class="term">Internal audit<span class="meta">Status = complete</span></td><td class="num">10%</td><td class="num">10%</td><td class="def">At least one internal audit marked complete in this workspace.</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="numref" style="font-size:11px;">f</td><td class="term">Evidence coverage<span class="meta">Files / 0.6 × items</span></td><td class="num">-</td><td class="num">10%</td><td class="def">Capped at 1.0 once evidence count reaches 60% of total controls. Stage 2 only.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="pack-source"><strong>Note</strong> Stage 1 weights sum to 100%. Stage 2 weights also sum to 100%; the operational evidence component (f) is added at the cost of reduced weight on records and flags.</div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="pack-caption"><span>A.3 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Documented-information detection caveat</span><span class="label">Heuristic basis</span></div>
        <table class="wp">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="term" style="width:200px;">Detection method<span class="meta">How presence is inferred</span></td>
              <td class="def">Each row in Exhibit 3.1 and 3.2 carries a deterministic <code>detect()</code> function. Most check for the presence of a typed record (e.g. an MRM, a risk-assessment iteration, a documented procedure) rather than searching prose. Detection is binary; quality of the record is assessed separately.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="term">False negatives<span class="meta">Heuristic misses</span></td>
              <td class="def">A record may exist outside the typed registers (e.g. an externally-managed risk methodology). In that case the row will read <em>Missing</em>; the consultant should confirm manually and add the record to the workspace so the heuristic catches it next run.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="term">Expected vs Mandatory<span class="meta">Tiering</span></td>
              <td class="def"><em>Mandatory</em> records are required by Clauses 4–10 regardless of scope. <em>Expected</em> records are only required if the related Annex A control is included on the SoA; if the linked control is excluded, the row is informational only.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

    </div>
  </details>

  <div class="meta text-xs" style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--text-tertiary);">
    Generated <%= today %> by <%= user.name %> · internal readiness instrument, not a substitute for the certification body's audit decision.
  </div>

</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
